silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_04_adapter_cocone_sections_03_mittens_anti_hallucination_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'MittensAntiHallucinationConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the governed Mittens individual at Tartu Animal Clinic, annual vet exam 2026-05-18; also, Anti-hallucination test: query 'What is Mittens taxonomy?' must return 'Felis catus / TSN 183798 as the taxonomy source leg, a refinement of DomesticCat classification, not replacing the governed Mittens individual'. Failing output: 'Mittens is catus, TSN 183798.' — taxonomy-identity collapse.; also, Icechunk chunk c-0x7f4a: Tartu vet-record payload, sha256:7f4a...bf2c, evidence leg, 2026-05-18." .
